==Rolling Stock==
Matsuden is known for its distinctive "Forest Green" and "Cream" livery.
* '''3000 Series:''' High-capacity commuter trains used for the dense eastern sector.
* '''Limited Express "Kaguya":''' A luxury sightseeing train running from the northern mountains to the Tarumi beaches.

